        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a highly focused and experienced team that conducts proprietary primary market research, forms its own views on the clinical and commercial outlook for the product, and builds its own financial models, allowing us to generate direct insights and to take significant accountability and ownership for our investments.",
        "start_character": 19131,
        "end_character": 19454
      },
      {
